Akai's firmware
---------------
This repository and its releases contain no Akai firmware, bootloader, or other Akai proprietary files.
The flashing tools assemble a complete image locally on your computer from Akai's stock firmware image,
which tools/fetch_stock.py retrieves from Akai's public installer (or from a local file you supply) and
verifies against pinned SHA-256 checksums.

